ent/uploads/2024/08/about-us.webp 700w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-300x300.webp 300w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-150x150.webp 150w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-500x500.webp 500w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-120x120.webp 120w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-220x220.webp 220w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-390x390.webp 390w" width="640" height="640" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-15928 lazyload" alt=""  sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /><noscript><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="640" height="640" src="https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-15928" alt="" srcset="https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us.webp 700w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-300x300.webp 300w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-150x150.webp 150w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-500x500.webp 500w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-120x120.webp 120w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-220x220.webp 220w, https://think-schools.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-us-390x390.webp 390w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px"></noscript></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9855aee" data-id="9855aee" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a50449e ha-has-bg-overlay elementor-widget elementor-widget-rs-heading" data-id="a50449e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="rs-heading.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="rs-heading default "><div class="title-inner"> <span class="sub-text ">Welcome to THINK International Schools| Türkiye</span><h2 class="title"><span class="watermark"></span>Where Excellence Meets Education!</h2></div><div class="description"><p>Discover a leading international educational institution headquartered in Türkiye, dedicated to nurturing the next generation of thinkers, innovators, and global citizens. Rooted in advanced educational standards, we offer a holistic approach blending academic excellence with moral values and cultural awareness to prepare students for success in a rapidly changing world.</p><p>At TIS, our commitment to exceptional global education emphasizes English language proficiency and employs cutting-edge teaching methodologies.</p><p>Explore our website to learn more about our vision, mission, academic programs, and vibrant school community.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eaeb6f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-rs-button" data-id="eaeb6f2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="rs-button.default"><div class="elementor-widget-container"><div class="rs-view-btn"> <a class="rs-btn rs-btnblack rs-btn-style1" href="https://think-schools.org/about-us" > <span class="rs_btn__text"><span class="btn_text">Discover More</span></span> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a0c3b1f elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="a0c3b1f" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;,&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}"><div class="elementor-container elemen